# The Autobahn|Testsuite reference, pinned.
#
# One line, tab-separated: <name> <image> <version> <what it answers>.
#
# Unlike the other references (tools/oracle/containers/IMAGES) this image is
# not built here: it is the upstream image, so the pin is its manifest digest,
# and run.py ALSO asks the running container what it is, because a digest that
# was re-tagged or a mirror that served something else is only caught by the
# answer. The version field is exactly what the probe in run.py prints:
# autobahntestsuite, autobahn (the library under it), Twisted and PyPy.
#
# Raising the pin is deliberate and a separate commit from any change that
# makes a run green: a new suite is new cases and new expectations, and
# expected.tsv has to be re-derived (run.py --propose) and every difference
# read, not accepted.
#
# To resolve a newer digest:
#   docker pull docker.io/crossbario/autobahn-testsuite
#   docker image inspect docker.io/crossbario/autobahn-testsuite --format '{{index .RepoDigests 0}}'
# To fetch the pinned one on a new machine:
#   docker pull <the image column below>

